**1394** (\+16)  representative **complete ORF1** sequences are assigned to **64 Gammatorquevirus species** divided into **5 phylogenetic groups** (A-E).

ICTV species _"Gammatorquevirus homidi7"_ and _"Gammatorquevirus homidi14"_ are grouped together.

**50 putative species** are classified into 5 groups;

>    *A:*   Gammatorquevirus homidi16 to Gammatorquevirus homidi23
> 
>    *B:*   Gammatorquevirus homidi24 to Gammatorquevirus homidi50
> 
>    *C:*   Gammatorquevirus homidi50 to Gammatorquevirus homidi61
> 
>   *D:*   Gammatorquevirus homidi62 and  Gammatorquevirus homidi63
> 
>   *E:*   Gammatorquevirus homidi64 and Gammatorquevirus homidi65
